CORE libstdcxx
libstdcxx.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ invoke: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ mem_fn: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ namespace-scope pointer to member: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body
--
N5008 [func.require]/1.4-1.6, [func.memfn]: std::invoke and std::mem_fn of a
pointer to data member, and a namespace-scope pointer to data member.  On
bin53 libstdc++'s __invoke_impl for member objects (invoke.h:79/84) was
dropped and two of the assertions disappeared from the program.  g++ 13
accepts the program.
